OL,3,GNEWSARefurbishment plans approved for
OL,4,Aempty hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to refurbish a Grade II listed
OL,7,Fhotel which has been empty for two
OL,8,Fyears have been approved.
OL,10,FThe former Hotel Majestic on Duke
OL,11,FStreet, Barrow, would become a Garner
OL,12,FHotel under the IHG brand as part of
OL,13,Fthe proposals granted by Westmorland
OL,14,Fand Furness Council.
OL,16,FDeveloper Ashall Projects Limited said
OL,17,Fthe building "was in poor state of
OL,18,Frepair" as it submitted plans to
OL,19,Finstall a new interior, replace 12
OL,20,Fwindows and attach new signage.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
