OL,3,GNEWSARefurbishment plans approved for
OL,4,Aempty hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Liberal Democrat-led authority said
OL,7,Fwork must begin within three years and
OL,8,Fneeded to safeguard the character and
OL,9,Fappearance of the listed building,
OL,10,Fincluding keeping the replacement
OL,11,Fwindow frames white.
